  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/solutions/meeting-rooms/#main-content)\n\n# Meeting  Rooms\n\nOur collaboration experts design meeting rooms that connect your hybrid teams no matter where they work.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![An AI-ready meeting room with Crestron solutions and people around an oval table, Marketing Sync on screens, bright lights, and natural window light.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Crestron_Sightline_magazine_overview_boardroom_corr.jpg)\n\n### High-Impact    Hybrid Meetings\n\nCreate positive experiences with collaboration spaces that support the user preferences of your hybrid workforce. Design considerations include interoperability, AI-powered technology, ease of use, standardization, security, and more.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/solutions/meeting-rooms/#contact)\n\n### We Support Your Preferred Meeting Room Solutions\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nCisco\nZoom\nGoogle Workspace\n\n![Five people at a conference table on a video call; large screen shows remote participants, room is bright and modern.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL_SignatureMicrosoft_0005_-scaled.jpg)\n\nOur Microsoft Practice experts create hybrid meeting spaces integrating Microsoft Teams, Teams Rooms, Teams Phones, Copilot, Places, and Surface Hub.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)\n\n![Four people sit at a modern office table for a video call; on-screen, a man and woman converse. A staircase is in the background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cisco_Lifestyle-23-1.jpg)\n\nHarness the power of Cisco with AVI-SPL’s expertise. Our Cisco practice supports Webex Suite and Calling Solutions, Cisco Contact Center and Cloud Calling, Enterprise Networking, and more.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/cisco/)\n\n![A man in a modern office on a video call, gesturing with hands. Bright windows and colorful decor in the background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Hybrid-Workforce_Experiences_mock-3-scaled.jpg)\n\nZoom offers solutions for meetings, conference rooms, collaboration spaces, phone systems, scheduling panels, and digital signage. Our team is here to help every step of the way.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n![Five people in a modern meeting room are engaged in a video call, with a large screen, tablet, and cylindrical device on the table.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sight-LIFE-Google-Meet-03-1-2-scaled.jpg)\n\nGoogle Workspace is an integrated cloud-based collaboration suite offering Google Meet video conferencing to connect remote teams.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/google/)\n\n## MeetingRoomDesignConsiderations\n\n- ###### Meeting Equity\n\n\n\n\nInclude remote users with speaker framing, clear audio, and access to meeting tools.\n\n- ###### Interoperability\n\n\n\n\nDeliver a native platform experience across your preferred solutions.\n\n- ###### Ease of Use\n\n\n\n\nMake meeting effortless with technology standards, automation, and simple control UIs.\n\n- ###### AI-Powered Technology\n\n\n\n\nDeploy the latest tools, including devices, software, translations, summaries, and note-taking.\n\n- ###### Sustainability\n\n\n\n\nChoose technology providers that support company sustainability goals.\n\n- ###### Security\n\n\n\n\nSupport IT privacy standards with secure meetings and content sharing.\n\n- ###### ADA Compliance\n\n\n\n\nEnsure physical spaces meet ADA guidelines for accessibility.\n\n\n### AVI-SPLConcept  Catalog\n\nUse the articles in our concept catalog to inspire ideas to create a human-centric work and learning spaces. See our featured case study and partner solutions.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/resource/concept-catalog/)\n\nServices\n\n### Wemanageandsupport  yourmeetingroomecosystem\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/contact-us/)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Unified Communications**](https://avispl.com/solutions/unified-communications-collaboration/) [![A person in a headset and black vest smiles while working at a computer, with multiple monitors and a screen showing Dublin.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Managed-Services-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Managed Services**](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/) [![A woman in denim smiles, chatting amidst colleagues wearing headsets, focused on screens in a bright office.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-12672706971-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Contact Centers**](https://avispl.com/solutions/contact-centers/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Support and Maintenance**](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/)\n\n14\n\n![Woman in orange blouse on video call, holding paper. Notebooks and pen on desk; airy room with plants in background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/content-module-1.jpg)\n\nCase Studies\n\n### Enhance Employee Experience\n\nStandardization and hot desking\n\nsupport airport operations.\n\n[View More](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/tampa-international-airport-skycenter-one/)\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)",
